{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:0.1", "PA_thag_1.24:0.2", "PA_thag_1.24:0.3"], "en": "Theragāthā 1.24 Ekakanipāta Tatiyavagga (The Third Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Sugandha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:1.1"], "en": "“Having gone forth in the very year [of my birth],", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:1.2"], "en": "behold the excellence of the Dhamma!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:1.3"], "en": "“The three knowledges have been attained;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:1.4"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.24:1.5"], "en": "… [Thus spoke] the Elder Sugandha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
